{"id":"A2-L104","title":"Relative clauses (who, that, which): introduction","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U07","focus":"Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — introdução","pron":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","verbs":["grow"],"pv":[],"expr":["I lost my…"],"words":["recipe notebook","bean soup","dry beans","kind neighbor","old page","soaking time","missing page","kitchen drawer","handwriting","salt pinch","long night","warm bowl","home taste","too cold","instruction","introduction"],"field":"Problemas simples","genre":"Receita e instruções","skill":"Escrita","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 104 · Relative clauses (who, that, which): introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — introdução.","**Verbos:** grow.","**Expressões:** I lost my….","**Pronúncia:** Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/.","**16 palavras novas** (problemas simples).","**Texto do dia:** receita e instruções."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo descrever pessoas e coisas com who, that e which, e dizer I lost my…"},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["recipe notebook","caderno de receitas"],["bean soup","sopa de feijão"],["dry beans","feijão seco"],["kind neighbor","vizinha gentil"],["old page","página antiga"],["soaking time","tempo de molho"],["missing page","página faltando"],["kitchen drawer","gaveta da cozinha"],["handwriting","letra de mão"],["salt pinch","pitada de sal"],["long night","noite longa"],["warm bowl","tigela quente"],["home taste","sabor de casa"],["too cold","too cold"],["instruction","instruction"],["introduction","introduction"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A recipe","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lost Recipe, Found","paras":["I lost my grandmother’s notebook, **which** had every recipe. A neighbor **who** loves cooking helped me. She found a page **that** I **grew** up with: bean soup, **which** my family made on cold days.","The beans **that** you buy dry **grow** when you soak them. Soak them overnight!"],"kicker":"RECIPE · STORY","by":"Home cook","gloss":[["soak","deixar de molho"],["dry","seco"],["notebook","caderno"],["overnight","de um dia para o outro"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The notebook had every recipe.","ans":"T","why":"which had every recipe."},{"q":"A neighbor lost the notebook.","ans":"F","why":"the narrator lost it."},{"q":"Dry beans grow when soaked.","ans":"T","why":"grow when you soak them."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“soak” = ?","opts":["deixar de molho","sentar","secar"],"ans":0,"why":"soak."},{"q":"“overnight” = ?","opts":["durante a noite","noturno só","amanhã"],"ans":0,"why":"overnight."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Relative clauses","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pronome","Para…","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**who**","pessoas","**A neighbor who loves cooking.**"],["**which**","coisas","**A notebook which had recipes.**"],["**that**","pessoas ou coisas","**A page that I grew up with.**"]],"cap":"Relative clauses"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Ligam duas ideias: *I lost the notebook. It had every recipe.* → *I lost the notebook which had every recipe.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"A neighbor ___ loves cooking helped. (who)","a":"who","why":"pessoa."},{"s":"A notebook ___ had every recipe. (which)","a":"which","why":"coisa."},{"s":"A page ___ I grew up with. (that)","a":"that","why":"que."},{"s":"I ___ my notebook. (lose, past)","a":"lost","why":"lose-lost.","say":"I lost my…"}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["recipe notebook","caderno de receitas"],["bean soup","sopa de feijão"],["dry beans","feijão seco"],["cold day","dia frio"],["family recipe","receita de família"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["lost","my","notebook","I"],"ans":"I lost my notebook","pt":"Perdi meu caderno."},{"words":["had","recipes","The","one","which"],"ans":"The one which had recipes","pt":"O que tinha receitas?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"recipe notebook","pos":"word","pt":"caderno de receitas","ex":"A recipe notebook.","expt":"Um caderno de receitas."},{"w":"bean soup","pos":"word","pt":"sopa de feijão","ex":"Bean soup.","expt":"Sopa de feijão."},{"w":"dry beans","pos":"word","pt":"feijão seco","ex":"Dry beans.","expt":"Feijão seco."},{"w":"kind neighbor","pos":"word","pt":"vizinha gentil","ex":"A kind neighbor.","expt":"Uma vizinha gentil."},{"w":"old page","pos":"word","pt":"página antiga","ex":"An old page.","expt":"Uma página antiga."},{"w":"soaking time","pos":"word","pt":"tempo de molho","ex":"Soaking time.","expt":"Tempo de molho."},{"w":"missing page","pos":"word","pt":"página faltando","ex":"A missing page.","expt":"Uma página faltando."},{"w":"kitchen drawer","pos":"word","pt":"gaveta da cozinha","ex":"A kitchen drawer.","expt":"Uma gaveta da cozinha."},{"w":"handwriting","pos":"word","pt":"letra de mão","ex":"Her handwriting.","expt":"A letra dela."},{"w":"salt pinch","pos":"word","pt":"pitada de sal","ex":"A salt pinch.","expt":"Uma pitada de sal."},{"w":"long night","pos":"word","pt":"noite longa","ex":"A long night.","expt":"Uma noite longa."},{"w":"warm bowl","pos":"word","pt":"tigela quente","ex":"A warm bowl.","expt":"Uma tigela quente."},{"w":"home taste","pos":"word","pt":"sabor de casa","ex":"A home taste.","expt":"Um sabor de casa."},{"w":"too cold","pos":"word","pt":"too cold","ex":"frio demais","expt":"The room is too cold."},{"w":"instruction","pos":"word","pt":"instruction","ex":"instrução","expt":"A clear instruction."},{"w":"introduction","pos":"word","pt":"introduction","ex":"introdução","expt":"A short introduction."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I lost my…** — Perdi meu/minha…","**Look what I found!** — Veja o que achei!","**It rings a bell.** — Isso me lembra algo.","**I lost my notebook.** — Perdi meu caderno.","**The one which had recipes?** — O que tinha receitas?","**Yes, the one that my grandma wrote.** — Sim, o que minha vó escreveu.","**Let’s not jump to conclusions.** — Não vamos tirar conclusões precipitadas."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"grow","pt":"crescer","forms":[["I / you / we / they grow","Beans grow in water."],["he / she / it grows","The plant grows fast."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Lost and found","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Lost and found","lines":[["Ana","I lost my notebook.","Perdi meu caderno."],["Neighbor","The one which had recipes?","O que tinha receitas?"],["Ana","Yes, the one that my grandma wrote.","Sim, o que minha vó escreveu."],["Neighbor","I found a page that looks like it.","Achei uma página parecida."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","items":[{"label":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe a person with who.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"A friend who loves cooking."},{"q":"Describe a thing with which.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"A book which has recipes."},{"q":"Say what you lost.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I lost my keys."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with who, which, that.","model":"I lost my grandmother’s notebook, which had every recipe. A neighbor who loves cooking helped me. She found a page that I grew up with. The beans that you buy dry grow when soaked. I lost my keys last week.","checklist":["Usei **who / which / that**","Usei **lost**","Frases claras"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “recipe notebook” mean?","opts":["caderno de receitas","sopa de feijão","dia frio"],"ans":0,"why":"**recipe notebook** = caderno de receitas."},{"q":"What does “bean soup” mean?","opts":["feijão seco","sopa de feijão","receita de família"],"ans":1,"why":"**bean soup** = sopa de feijão."},{"q":"What does “dry beans” mean?","opts":["dia frio","vizinha gentil","feijão seco"],"ans":2,"why":"**dry beans** = feijão seco."},{"q":"What does “cold day” mean?","opts":["dia frio","receita de família","página antiga"],"ans":0,"why":"**cold day** = dia frio."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}